# LF on every checkout, a Windows one with core.autocrlf too: `sim` and the
# shell scripts run in a Linux container, whose bash cannot run CRLF; and the
# Dockerfiles and every source a prebuilt output's key hashes
# (testbed/prebuilt.py) must be the same bytes everywhere, or a Windows
# checkout names images and outputs nobody published. Binary files stay as
# they are.
* text=auto eol=lf
sim text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
